<text><loc_25><loc_215><loc_234><loc_265>In a recent volume of Fundamenta 1) two new proofs of this were given, together with references to earlier proofs by Préchet, Sierpiński, and Banach. We give another proof below, which is quite elementary and assumes less than measurability for f(x).</text>
